<title>FINLAND: VALMET MAIN SUPPLIER IN SEK 310 MLN DEAL.</title>
<headline>VALMET MAIN SUPPLIER IN SEK 310 MLN DEAL.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish paper machine engineering group Valmet said in a statement on Wednesday it would be the main supplier in a 310 million crown rebuild of Swedish SCA's Obbola linerboard machine.</p>
<p>&quot;Valmet will be the main supplier in the renewal, the total value of which is 310 million Swedish crowns,&quot; Valmet said.  </p>
<p>It said the modernised machine would be started up in late 1998.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 242, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
